{"4079820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Defender of the Kingdom", "steam_appid": 4079820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Defender of the Realm — An Indie Wave-Based Survival Adventure Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensor del Reyno is an indie wave-based defense game with exploration, resource gathering, and narrative progression. You control the Defender of the Realm, a warrior who must protect the castle as the world cycles thru two seasons—autumn and winter—with day-and-night cycles that change the difficulty and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the enemy’s creatures advance and winter grows harsher, you will rely on your skill, your strategy, and your allies: Elara (half-human, half-vampire) and Teryn, the castle builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is set in a different combination of day/night and autumn/winter, affecting the chapter’s resources, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ Wave Defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful hordes. Surviving each wave will be key to keeping the castle standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦️ Weather and Seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure takes place in:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍂 Autumn — Day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌙🍂 Autumn — Nite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ Winter — Day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️🌙 Winter — Nite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each combination affects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy aggression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪓 Resource Gathering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surroundings to gather:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is essential to repair, trade, or prepare the castle for the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 Full Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your weapons, materials, and tools to survive each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 Lockpick System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/extras/00e29e16214600dd9eea3dfa42108f6b.poster.avif?t=1775310535\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/extras/00e29e16214600dd9eea3dfa42108f6b.webm?t=1775310535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/extras/00e29e16214600dd9eea3dfa42108f6b.mp4?t=1775310535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open special doors and chests using a lockpicking system that requires precision and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎣 Fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/extras/c85f33da05a7e335861aba88c8104b88.poster.avif?t=1775310535\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/extras/c85f33da05a7e335861aba88c8104b88.webm?t=1775310535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/extras/c85f33da05a7e335861aba88c8104b88.mp4?t=1775310535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fishing at various spots on the map to obtain food, rare resources, or useful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Merchant of the Realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell essential materials, weapons, and upgrades for progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚒️ Repair of Towers and Walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Teryn reinforce walls and towers so they can withstand the strongest invasions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Special Missions by Chapter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter introduces unique challenges that change depending on the weather, the season, and the story, such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross an explosive maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources before winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the castle during long nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for gold in frozen landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the final battle on the coldest nite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and many more missions that will test your strategy and survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 Powerful Allies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elara: half-human, half-vampire; she controls fire and fights by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teryn: castle builder, expert in repairs and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 Narrative Summary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eldoria is under constant attack. As autumn fades and winter covers the world, the enemy’s creatures grow fiercer and more numerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Defender of the Realm, your mission will be to protect the castle, gather vital resources, work alongside your allies, and face relentless waves that grow stronger each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last nite of winter will determine the fate of the kingdom.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Defender of the Realm — An Indie Wave-Based Survival Adventure Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensor del Reyno is an indie wave-based defense game with exploration, resource gathering, and narrative progression. You control the Defender of the Realm, a warrior who must protect the castle as the world cycles thru two seasons—autumn and winter—with day-and-night cycles that change the difficulty and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the enemy’s creatures advance and winter grows harsher, you will rely on your skill, your strategy, and your allies: Elara (half-human, half-vampire) and Teryn, the castle builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is set in a different combination of day/night and autumn/winte