ss=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last nite of winter will determine the fate of the kingdom.</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Indie wave-based defense game with exploration and resource management. Protect the castle, face hordes, and complete missions as the weather and day/night cycle change with each challenge.&quot;", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/9965f423ea4edca13873bddbb2dfef6f8269052b/header.jpg?t=1775310535", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/f10ddcae75509d6c05d2e8ffb05a043b3ec5ccd7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775310535", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079820/f10ddcae75509d6c05d2e8ffb05a043b3ec5ccd7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775310535", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Operating system: Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or AMD Athlon X2 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / NVIDIA GeForce 8800 GT / AMD HD 4650 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Operating system: Wind